  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children and Armed Conflict</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children and Armed Conflict - core funding to Watchlist an international NGO that works on the protection of children affected by armed conflict. Watchlist works to protect the security and rights of children affected by armed conflict through: (a) advocacy to advance the UN&#x2019;s Children and Armed Conflict agenda; (b) partnerships to help monitor, report and respond to local needs; and (c) reporting on grave violations against children to protect children in war zones. In partnership with other civil society groups, Watchlist collects and disseminates information on violations against children in conflicts in order to influence key decision makers to create and implement programs and policies that effectively protect children.</narrative>
  </description>
